{
    "title": "Planner 5D: Home Design, Decor",
    "description": "Create beautiful interior designs for your room or house with Planner 5D, a floor plan creator app offering more than 6,723 elements to redecor your home. Ideal for home design enthusiasts and professionals, this app is your gateway to home makeover, remodel, and renovation dreams. Whether it\u2019s a sketchup project, a house flipper fantasy, or a spontaneous redecoration, with the help of AR Room visualization and 3D room planner it's easy and fun.\r\n\r\nBuild your dream home with Planner 5D, perfect for house decor and interior design. Use our AR Room visualization or our 3D room planner for your home design interior projects, ensuring every remodel or renovation reflects your unique style. Our app is a haven for those undertaking home renovation, offering endless possibilities to redecor and transform any space.\r\n\r\nWith Planner 5D, you can easily become a virtual house flipper, redesigning and redecorating spaces to your heart's content. Embellish your home design with interior decor like paintings, clocks, vases, and lamps. Use our app for house decor planning, whether it\u2019s a cozy bedroom, a functional kitchen, or a stylish living room. Redecor and redesign with ease, making each space uniquely yours.\r\n\r\nFor those who love to sketchup, Planner 5D offers the freedom to create and modify floor plans. Perfect for home remodel and renovation projects, our app allows you to visualize your ideas in 3D. Whether it\u2019s house decor or exterior landscaping, including pools and gardens, Planner 5D makes home design interactive and enjoyable.\r\n\r\nIn addition to home interior design, Planner 5D caters to more than just house decor. Plan and visualize the design of restaurants, cafes, or gyms. It's an all-in-one tool for those who love to redecor, remodel, or are involved in home renovation. Planner 5D bridges the gap between imagination and reality, helping you to sketchup and create the space you've always dreamed of.\r\n\r\nJoin our Planner 5D community, a place where home makeover dreams come true. Share your house flipper and home design interior projects, drawing inspiration for your next big remodel. Inspired by the likes of Houzz and Ikea, Planner 5D is your partner in transforming any space, from a simple redecor task to a comprehensive home renovation project.\r\n\r\nStart your journey with Planner 5D today and take the first step in your home design, house flipper, or home makeover project. Redefine your living space with style, creativity, and the joy of renovation and decoration!\r\n\r\nAR-Driven 3D Room Design Feature \u2013 a simple tool that lets you easily configure a layout with your room dimensions and see the final picture in real size.\r\nDesign house and room planner app features:\r\n- Furniture catalog: lots of items to use in your designs\r\n- Realistic snapshots: images of your designs' home and room\r\n- Big gallery: ideas of projects and images of designs of homes, rooms, floor plans created, interior decor, and landscape design by our users\r\n- Online and Offline: you can use the application to create home and interior design of rooms\r\n- Sign in with your planner5d.com, Google+, or Facebook account to use your home design across all platforms\r\n- User interface localized in these languages: English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Chinese, Japanese\r\n- View ideas for your house design using Chromecast (screencast)\r\n\r\nTake part in the competitions for the best interior design of the room on the theme of the week and get prizes!\r\nPlanner 5D team is inspired by Houzz, Modsy, Ashley HomeStore, Ikea, Williams-Sonoma, Pepperfry, Rooms to go and other great Home Improvement brands\r\n\r\nIF YOU HAVE QUESTIONS OR PROBLEMS:\r\n- Use our support form in the About dialog\r\n- Contact us at support@planner5d.com\r\n\r\nFollow us!\r\nFacebook- https://www.facebook.com/Planner5D\r\nTwitter - https://twitter.com/Planner5D\r\nInstagram - https://instagram.com/planner5d/\r\nWebsite - https://planner5d.com\"",
    "descriptionHTML": "Create beautiful interior designs for your room or house with Planner 5D, a floor plan creator app offering more than 6,723 elements to redecor your home. Ideal for home design enthusiasts and professionals, this app is your gateway to home makeover, remodel, and renovation dreams. Whether it\u2019s a sketchup project, a house flipper fantasy, or a spontaneous redecoration, with the help of AR Room visualization and 3D room planner it&#39;s easy and fun.<br><br>Build your dream home with Planner 5D, perfect for house decor and interior design. Use our AR Room visualization or our 3D room planner for your home design interior projects, ensuring every remodel or renovation reflects your unique style. Our app is a haven for those undertaking home renovation, offering endless possibilities to redecor and transform any space.<br><br>With Planner 5D, you can easily become a virtual house flipper, redesigning and redecorating spaces to your heart&#39;s content. Embellish your home design with interior decor like paintings, clocks, vases, and lamps. Use our app for house decor planning, whether it\u2019s a cozy bedroom, a functional kitchen, or a stylish living room. Redecor and redesign with ease, making each space uniquely yours.<br><br>For those who love to sketchup, Planner 5D offers the freedom to create and modify floor plans. Perfect for home remodel and renovation projects, our app allows you to visualize your ideas in 3D. Whether it\u2019s house decor or exterior landscaping, including pools and gardens, Planner 5D makes home design interactive and enjoyable.<br><br>In addition to home interior design, Planner 5D caters to more than just house decor. Plan and visualize the design of restaurants, cafes, or gyms. It&#39;s an all-in-one tool for those who love to redecor, remodel, or are involved in home renovation. Planner 5D bridges the gap between imagination and reality, helping you to sketchup and create the space you&#39;ve always dreamed of.<br><br>Join our Planner 5D community, a place where home makeover dreams come true. Share your house flipper and home design interior projects, drawing inspiration for your next big remodel. Inspired by the likes of Houzz and Ikea, Planner 5D is your partner in transforming any space, from a simple redecor task to a comprehensive home renovation project.<br><br>Start your journey with Planner 5D today and take the first step in your home design, house flipper, or home makeover project. Redefine your living space with style, creativity, and the joy of renovation and decoration!<br><br>AR-Driven 3D Room Design Feature \u2013 a simple tool that lets you easily configure a layout with your room dimensions and see the final picture in real size.<br>Design house and room planner app features:<br>- Furniture catalog: lots of items to use in your designs<br>- Realistic snapshots: images of your designs&#39; home and room<br>- Big gallery: ideas of projects and images of designs of homes, rooms, floor plans created, interior decor, and landscape design by our users<br>- Online and Offline: you can use the application to create home and interior design of rooms<br>- Sign in with your planner5d.com, Google+, or Facebook account to use your home design across all platforms<br>- User interface localized in these languages: English, German, French, Italian, Spanish, Portuguese, Russian, Chinese, Japanese<br>- View ideas for your house design using Chromecast (screencast)<br><br>Take part in the competitions for the best interior design of the room on the theme of the week and get prizes!<br>Planner 5D team is inspired by Houzz, Modsy, Ashley HomeStore, Ikea, Williams-Sonoma, Pepperfry, Rooms to go and other great Home Improvement brands<br><br>IF YOU HAVE QUESTIONS OR PROBLEMS:<br>- Use our support form in the About dialog<br>- Contact us at support@planner5d.com<br><br>Follow us!<br>Facebook- https://www.facebook.com/Planner5D<br>Twitter - https://twitter.com/Planner5D<br>Instagram - https://instagram.com/planner5d/<br>Website - https://planner5d.com&quot;",
